{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322112001:0":{"text":"戻られたんですね！セントヴァレサ教会の方はどうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了！圣瓦勒沙教堂那里如何了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D3BC465D7A5EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322112001":{"text":"戻られたんですね！セントヴァレサ教会の方はどうでしたか？","source_cn":"你们回来了！圣金嘉教堂那里如何了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D3BC465D7A5EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322112002:1":{"text":"そ、そんな。どうすれば……","source_cn":"这……这该怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C7938CE085C4C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322112003:0":{"text":"屍は私たちが追い払ったので、教会の周りはもう安全ですよ。","source_cn":"我们驱逐了那些活死人，现在圣瓦勒沙教堂应该很安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA306E7C10ABA5A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322112005:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様に感謝！やはりあなた方は女神様が遣わされた使者なのですね！","source_cn":"噢，艾雅保佑！实在是太感谢了，你们果然是女神派来的使者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86CDBA9538D53C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",